OL,3,GNEWSAStreet shut over hotel building
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA street has been partially closed over
OL,7,Fbuilding safety concerns following the
OL,8,Fcollapse of masonry and part of a
OL,9,Fceiling at a hotel in Dorset.
OL,11,FJust before 13:00 BST, the fire service
OL,12,Fsaid a number of properties in South
OL,13,FStreet, Wareham, had been evacuated as
OL,14,Fa "precaution".
OL,16,FIn a statement later on Sunday, The
OL,17,FBear Hotel said: "This morning we
OL,18,Fdiscovered structural damage in one of
OL,19,Four second floor guest bedrooms."
OL,21,FThe room was unoccupied at the time and
OL,22,Fno-one was hurt, it said.
